    "updated_at": "2026-11-23T19:07:46Z",
    "body": "﻿The machine file on PR #3736 now uses the smaller travel value on each axis. The maintainer made this decision on 2026-11-23.\n\n- X 1200 mm: the figure from MisterMaker. It is inside the 1270 mm that Ooznest publishes.\n- Y 770 mm: the figure that Ooznest publishes. The 800 mm from MisterMaker is more than this value.\n- Z 88 mm: the figure that Ooznest publishes. MisterMaker did not give a Z travel.\n\nA smaller travel can refuse a program that the machine can run. It cannot let a move go past the real end of travel.\n\n@mkinney, please ask MisterMaker to confirm these items before the values are final:\n- his frame size (the issue says 1500 x 1000, but he is not sure);\n- his real X, Y and Z travel.\r\n",
    "author_association": "OWNER",
